            $VER: Digits ReadMe, v1.31 (27-Sep-97) by Dotoran!
============================================================================

What Is It?
~~~~~~~~~~~
    A single player game for CNet 3.05c and 4.28d!

How to Install It?
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

    Copy the "Digits" file somewhere on your system, like in DOORS:

How to Use It?
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

    Add it as an ARexx PFile Door into your system. You could even create a
    command in BBSMENU like this one:

        DIGITS  `3-     |   {<path>Digits}
                 ^          ^   ^
             Accesses   Ctrl-Q  `-- Where you chose to store the file.

Closing
~~~~~~~
    Another quickie game by Dotoran! Hope you enjoy it!

